    {
      "heading": {
        "text": "1. MASTER PRODUCTION RATE GOVERNOR",
        "level": 1
      },
      "level": 1,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "A \"Plant Load\" setpoint (expressed as % of 100 t/d nameplate, range: 50–110%) entered by the operator at the DCS cascades to all unit production-rate-dependent controllers. The Governor calculates the required sulfur mass flow and air volumetric flow targets for the current load and passes them as remote setpoints to FIC-101 and FIC-201 respectively, with lead/lag sequencing (air leads on load increase; sulfur leads on load reduction).",
          "style": "Normal"
        }
      ],
